ver be healed the same can't be said  about us and that's why i'm grateful to  akaza for turning me into a demon and to  muzon for accepting and introducing me  to the ranks of the upper moons his  words trigger tantro who begins to  reminisce about the mujin train incident  and how rangoku became a demon but giu's  screams bring him back to reality giyu  already exhausted and in severe pain  could do nothing but continue listening  to rangoku speaking as it is the both of  you stand no chance against me i've  honed my skills and reached the realm of  the highest  i am no longer constrained to the  limitations of the human body my flame  breathing techniques have become  exponentially more powerful one strike  from my blood demon arc could spell the  end for both of you in this sorry state  well enough of this chit chat prepare to  meet your end tomioka fire breathing  first form unknowing fire  rengoku charged towards gilu in an  attempt to decapitate him in one slash  yiyu realizing this is his final moment  decides to use his final form and most  powerful attack to block and deal as  much damage as possible to rengoku water  breathing eleventh form dead calm guil  launched a series of extremely fast  imperceptible slashes towards raging  rangoku tangero stared up in awe as the  whole place was covered in smoke as a  result of the clashes between rangoku's  and giu's attacks  after about a minute of staring at the  smoke tanjaro was surprised to see  giulio's head on the floor with rengoku  being visibly wounded this made tundra  begin to wonder and remember his last  moments with rengoku before he was  transformed into a demon and how  surprised he was when rangoku accepted  akaza's offer being enraged he took one  last stare of hatred at rangoku he hated  everything about him rangoku's  appearance irritated him transformed  rangoku had two horns on his head with  the same facial appearance but had  bloodshot eyes and sharp teeth that he  exposed at every opportu